<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual added.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Washington Mutual added.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said Monday it added Washington Mutual Inc to its priority list, after having the company on its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1/2 to 62-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
